      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Drew%20Zimmerman\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Drew Zimmerman</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Executive Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Zimmerman has over 15 years of experience in the financial services and resource sectors. He previously served as a derivatives trader and has been involved in various capacities with public resource companies.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Jay%20Shrewder\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Jay Shrewder</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">June 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Financial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Shrewder is a Chartered Professional Accountant with extensive experience in financial reporting and corporate finance for junior exploration companies.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Darren%20Hazelwood\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Darren Hazelwood</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Vice President, Corporate Development</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Hazelwood has over 20 years of experience in the mining industry, focusing on project management and corporate development.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Graham%20Downs\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Graham Downs</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">August 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Downs has over 25 years of experience in the mineral exploration industry and is currently the CEO of Cascadia Minerals Ltd.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Drew%20Zimmerman\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Drew Zimmerman</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Zimmerman is the CEO of the company and has a background in derivatives trading and resource sector finance.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Bill%20Sheriff\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Bill Sheriff</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">March 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Sheriff is a seasoned mining executive with over 30 years of experience. He was the founder and Chairman of Energy Metals Corp. and has held numerous board positions in the uranium sector.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Stephen%20Roman\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Stephen Roman</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Roman is a prominent figure in the Canadian mining industry, having led several successful resource companies, including Global Atomic Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Graham%20Downs\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Graham Downs</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">August 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Downs has over 25 years of experience in the mineral exploration industry and is currently the CEO of Cascadia Minerals Ltd.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sources</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://stallionuranium.com/about/team/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Company Website - Management and Board Team Page</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-05-20)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sedarplus.ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">SEDAR+ Management Information Circular</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-04-15)</span></li></ul>"
